      ['name' => 'Old Fourth Ward', 'blurb' => 'Historic neighborhood along the BeltLine Eastside Trail, home to Ponce City Market and newer apartment buildings.'],
      ['name' => 'Virginia-Highland', 'blurb' => 'Charming neighborhood of bungalows, tree-lined streets, and neighborhood restaurants, close to Emory and Midtown.'],
      ['name' => 'Inman Park', 'blurb' => 'Victorian homes, BeltLine access, and Krog Street Market, with a MARTA station nearby.'],
      ['name' => 'Decatur', 'blurb' => 'A separate city east of Atlanta with a walkable downtown square and MARTA access. Popular with families and Emory-affiliated renters.'],
      ['name' => 'West Midtown', 'blurb' => 'Former industrial area turned dining and design district, close to Georgia Tech.'],
      ['name' => 'Grant Park', 'blurb' => 'Historic neighborhood around one of the city\'s oldest parks and Zoo Atlanta, with Victorian homes and a quieter pace.'],
    ],
    'prices' => '<p>Atlanta is generally more affordable than many coastal cities, though intown neighborhoods near the BeltLine and Midtown command higher prices. Furnished private rooms commonly advertise somewhere in the $800&ndash;$1,300 per month range, while entire furnished one-bedrooms in popular intown areas typically run higher, often $1,700 or more.</p><p>These ranges are approximate, not official data. Prices vary by season, neighborhood and furnishing, so compare current listings before committing.</p>',
    'transit'=> '<p>MARTA operates four heavy rail lines &mdash; Red, Gold, Blue, and Green &mdash; along with buses and the Atlanta Streetcar downtown. The Red and Gold lines run directly to Hartsfield-Jackson Atlanta International Airport, one of the busiest airports in the world. The BeltLine&rsquo;s trails offer walking and biking routes between intown neighborhoods.</p><p>Outside the rail corridors, most residents drive. If your job is in the suburbs, plan for highway commutes and check whether your sublet includes parking.</p>',
    'tips' => [
      'interns'  => 'Many internships are in Midtown, Downtown, and Buckhead, all served by MARTA rail. Midtown is a particularly convenient base for a summer stay.',
