      'students' => 'Georgia Tech, Emory, Georgia State, and the historically Black colleges of the Atlanta University Center, including Morehouse, Spelman, and Clark Atlanta, all generate sublet supply. Summer sublets near campuses are common.',
      'seasonal' => 'Demand follows the academic calendar and summer internship season, while film production and corporate relocations keep the market active year-round.',
